(globalThis.TURBOPACK||(globalThis.TURBOPACK=[])).push(["object"==typeof document?document.currentScript:void 0,16975,(e,a,t)=>{a.exports=JSON.parse('{"01 / BROWSE":"01 / 浏览","01 Know what warehouse photos can prove":"01 了解仓库照片可以证明什么","01 Start with what the official claims do—and do not—mean":"01 首先了解官方声明的含义和含义","01 Understand the service before you order":"01 下单前了解服务","02 / LIVE INDEX":"02 / 实时指数","02 Prepare the reference before the item arrives":"02 物品到达前准备好参考资料","02 Separate every layer of delivered cost":"02 分离每一层交付成本","02 Start with the exact live product link":"02 从准确的实时产品链接开始","03 / QC METHOD":"03 / 质控方法","03 Build the budget in layers":"03 分层制定预算","03 Match the ordered variant first":"03 首先匹配订购的变体","03 Understand actual and volumetric weight":"03 了解实际重量和体积重量","04 / RESEARCH NOTES":"04 / 研究笔记","04 Filter route eligibility before comparing price":"04 在比较价格之前过滤路线资格","04 Use measurements instead of size letters":"04 使用测量值代替尺寸字母","04 Write objective order instructions":"04 撰写客观订单指令","05 / FAQ":"05 / 常见问题解答","05 Inspect construction in a fixed order":"05 按顺序检查施工","05 Track seller dispatch and warehouse receipt":"05 跟踪卖家发货和仓单","05 Use storage and consolidation as planning tools":"05 使用存储和整合作为规划工具","06 Build low, expected and high scenarios":"06 构建低情景、预期情景和高情景","06 Separate damage from glare, dust and compression":"06 隔离眩光、灰尘和压缩造成的损坏","06 Use warehouse QC as a decision gate":"06 使用仓库QC作为决策门","07 Choose one of four clear outcomes":"07 选择四个明确结果之一","07 Consolidate and choose packaging deliberately":"07 精心整合和选择包装","07 Read the live quote like an invoice":"07 像阅读发票一样阅读实时报价","08 Keep evidence and read reviews critically":"08 保存证据并批判性地阅读评论","08 Submit shipping and keep a complete record":"08 提交发货并保留完整记录","08 Treat customer reports as signals, not rate cards":"08 将客户报告视为信号，而不是价目表","11 MIN READ":"11 分钟阅读","12 MIN READ":"12 分钟阅读","22 AUG":"8月22日","6 / 6 rows":"6 / 6 行","A Hipobuy QC photo is evidence of what the warehouse camera could see on the received item at a particular time. It may confirm the visible color, size label, quantity, broad shape, packaging and obvious damage. That is valuable because the seller image and the item that arrived can be compared before international shipping. It is not, however, a certificate of authenticity, material composition, exact fit, electrical life or long-term durability.":"Hipobuy QC 照片是仓库摄像头在特定时间可以在收到的物品上看到的证据。它可以确认可见颜色、尺寸标签、数量、大致形状、包装和明显损坏。这很有价值，因为可以在国际运输之前比较卖家形象和到达的物品。然而，它并不是真品、材料成分、精确配合、电气寿命或长期耐用性的证书。","A Hipobuy spreadsheet is most useful when it shortens discovery without hiding the source listing. Begin with the exact product record, not a cropped screenshot, social-media caption or generic marketplace homepage. Open the destination page and check that it still resolves. Then compare the current title, seller, images, available variants and option-specific prices with the directory entry. A listing can remain online while the variant you wanted has sold out or changed.":"Hipobuy 电子表格在缩短发现时间而不隐藏源列表时最有用。从准确的产品记录开始，而不是裁剪的屏幕截图、社交媒体标题或通用市场主页。打开目标页面并检查它是否仍然可以解析。然后将当前标题、卖家、图像、可用变体和特定于选项的价格与目录条目进行比较。当您想要的款式已售完或发生更改时，列表可以保留在线。","A Hipobuy spreadsheet price normally refers to the product, not the delivered total. Build the budget in layers: seller price, domestic delivery to the warehouse, optional purchasing or warehouse services, packing choices, international freight, payment or currency-conversion effects and destination tax or duty where applicable. Not every order will use every layer, but hiding one does not make it disappear.":"Hipobuy 电子表格价格通常指的是产品，而不是交付的总额。分层制定预算：卖方价格、国内交货到仓库、可选的采购或仓库服务、包装选择、国际运费、付款或货币兑换影响以及适用的目的地税或关税。并非每个订单都会使用每一层，但隐藏一层并不会让它消失。","A critical closure or accessory is hidden.":"关键的闭合件或配件被隐藏。","A decision-by-decision route from product link to warehouse review.":"从产品链接到仓库审核的逐个决策路线。","A fact-checked workflow for product selection, order notes, warehouse review, 90-day storage planning, consolidation and international shipping.":"针对产品选择、订单备注、仓库审查、90 天存储规划、整合和国际运输的事实核查工作流程。","A fact-checked workflow for using a Hipobuy spreadsheet without confusing discovery, warehouse inspection and international shipping.":"使用 Hipobuy 电子表格进行事实核查的工作流程，不会混淆发现、仓库检查和国际运输。","A mark may be glare, dust or damage.":"标记可能是眩光、灰尘或损坏。","A practical inspection system for variants, measurements, construction, damage, evidence requests and a defensible warehouse decision.":"一个实用的检查系统，用于检查变型、测量、结构、损坏、证据请求和合理的仓库决策。","A practical way to estimate the delivered cost without inventing a universal rate or confusing item price with parcel shipping.":"一种估算递送成本的实用方法，无需发明通用费率或将物品价格与包裹运输混淆。","A product link helps you discover an item. Warehouse photographs help you evaluate the item that arrived. Use this order so an attractive first image does not hide a material problem.":"产品链接可帮助您发现商品。仓库照片可帮助您评估到达的物品。使用此顺序，以便有吸引力的第一张图像不会隐藏实质性问题。","A reflection can look like a scratch, and a real scratch can disappear in reflection. Plastic wrap can create creases and bright lines. Dark fabric may show dust that is easy to remove, while compression during domestic transit can temporarily distort shape. Compare the same location across all angles before deciding what the image proves.":"反射可能看起来像划痕，而真正的划痕可能会在反射中消失。保鲜膜会产生折痕和亮线。深色织物可能会出现易于清除的灰尘，而国内运输过程中的压缩可能会暂时扭曲形状。在决定图像证明什么之前，从各个角度比较同一位置。","A repeatable inspection sequence for turning warehouse images into a clear approve, evidence, exchange or return decision.":"可重复的检查序列，用于将仓库图像转化为明确的批准、证据、交换或退货决定。","A scale gives actual weight. Some international routes also calculate volumetric or dimensional weight from the parcel’s outer dimensions. The chargeable weight may be the larger result. This is why a light but bulky parcel can cost more than a dense parcel with the same scale weight. The calculation divisor, rounding rule and minimum billable increment can vary by route, so do not publish one formula as if it applies everywhere.":"秤给出的是实际重量。一些国际航线还根据包裹的外部尺寸计算体积或尺寸重量。计费重量可能是较大的结果。这就是为什么重量轻但体积大的包裹比具有相同秤重的密集包裹更昂贵的原因。计算除数、舍入规则和最小计费增量可能因路线而异，因此不要发布一个公式，就好像它适用于所有地方一样。","A single early estimate creates false precision. Use three scenarios. The low case assumes compact packing and an eligible economical route. The expected case uses a realistic parcel weight, ordinary packing and a route you would actually accept. The high case allows for greater chargeable weight, a restricted line, currency movement or another legitimate cost layer. Use the expected case to decide whether to buy and keep a margin toward the high case.":"单一的早期估计会产生错误的精度。使用三种场景。低箱假设紧凑的包装和合格的经济路线。预期的情况使用实际的包裹重量、普通包装和您实际接受的路线。高箱允许更大的计费重量、限制线路、货币流动或其他合法成本层。使用预期情况来决定是否购买并针对高情况保留保证金。","A size label or measurement is unreadable.":"尺码标签或尺寸无法辨认。","A size letter is a seller label, not a universal dimension. For clothing, compare chest width, total length, shoulder, sleeve, waist or inseam only when those measurements matter to you. Say whether a width is measured flat and name the endpoints. For footwear, internal length is more informative than the outsole, but it may be difficult to capture accurately; compare the seller chart, label and a familiar pair rather than demanding false precision.":"尺寸字母是卖家标签，而不是通用尺寸。对于服装，只有当这些尺寸对您很重要时，才比较胸宽、总长度、肩部、袖子、腰部或内缝。说出宽度是否是平坦测量的并命名端点。对于鞋类来说，内部长度比外底的信息更丰富，但可能很难准确捕捉；比较卖家的图表、标签和熟悉的配对，而不是要求虚假的精确度。","A transparent cost model covering product price, domestic delivery, packing, chargeable weight, route eligibility and customs uncertainty.":"透明的成本模型，涵盖产品价格、国内交付、包装、计费重量、路线资格和海关不确定性。","A useful Hipobuy shipping-cost estimate therefore begins with uncertainty stated honestly. Before warehouse receipt, you can test whether a basket is plausible. After item weights are recorded, the estimate improves. After consolidation and packing, the live quote becomes the decision tool. Anyone offering one fixed rate from a product screenshot is omitting information that can materially change the bill.":"因此，有用的 Hipobuy 运输成本估算始于诚实地陈述不确定性。在仓单收货之前，您可以测试一篮子是否合理。记录物品重量后，估算会有所改善。经过整合和打包后，实时报价成为决策工具。任何从产品屏幕截图中提供固定费率的人都忽略了可能会严重改变账单的信息。","A useful review article should show its method: date checked, platform, number and recency of visible reviews, recurring themes, obvious promotional language and what cannot be verified. For your own order, the strongest evidence remains the exact listing, the paid variant, the warehouse record and the final parcel data. QC works when it connects those records into a decision, not when it creates the feeling that risk has disappeared.":"一篇有用的评论文章应该表明它的方法：检查日期、平台、可见评论的数量和新近度、重复出现的主题、明显的促销语言以及无法验证的内容。对于您自己的订单，最有力的证据仍然是确切的列表、付费版本、仓库记录和最终包裹数据。当质量控制将这些记录连接成决策时，而不是当它给人一种风险已经消失的感觉时，质量控制才起作用。","Accessories":"配件","Act while the live return window and seller options are still available. The exact policy, fees and seller cooperation can vary, so do not invent a universal return promise from another buyer’s experience. Use the order-specific workflow, provide the relevant images and state the mismatch factually. “Ordered black, received blue” is easier to evaluate than “bad product.”":"在实时退货窗口和卖家选项仍然可用的情况下采取行动。确切的政策、费用和卖家合作可能会有所不同，因此不要根据其他买家的经验发明普遍的退货承诺。使用特定于订单的工作流程，提供相关图像并如实说明不匹配之处。 “订购黑色，收到蓝色”比“不良产品”更容易评价。","Actual weight":"实际重量","Actual weight comes from the parcel scale.":"实际重量来自包裹秤。","After payment, retain the platform parcel number and carrier tracking reference. Processing, carrier handoff, export, customs and final delivery should be read as separate events. A pause between scans does not automatically prove a lost parcel, but a prolonged or unexplained status deserves an order-specific support request with dates and references.":"付款后，保留平台包裹号码和承运商跟踪参考。加工、承运人交接、出口、海关和最终交付应视为单独的事件。扫描之间的暂停不会自动证明包裹丢失，但长时间或无法解释的状态需要针对特定​​订单的支持请求，并提供日期和参考信息。","After payment, save the parcel number, route name, declared information, carrier reference and final amount. Tracking can pause between scans without proving loss, but a long or unexplained status should be raised through the order-specific support channel. Include dates and references. If a delivery issue occurs, that record helps distinguish warehouse processing, carrier movement, customs and last-mile responsibility.":"付款后，保存包裹号码、路线名称、申报信息、承运商参考号和最终金额。跟踪可以在扫描之间暂停而不会证明丢失，但应通过特定于订单的支持渠道提出长时间或无法解释的状态。包括日期和参考文献。如果发生交付问题，该记录有助于区分仓库处理、承运人移动、海关和最后一英里责任。","After purchase, the seller still has to dispatch domestically. A created order is not the same as a shipped item, and a domestic tracking event is not an international tracking event. Watch for seller delays, cancellations or option questions inside the order record. If support contacts you about a changed price or unavailable variation, compare the proposed change with your saved reference before approving it.":"购买后，卖家仍需向国内发货。创建的订单与已发货的商品不同，国内追踪事件也不同于国际追踪事件。留意订单记录中的卖家延迟、取消或选项问题。如果支持人员就价格更改或不可用版本与您联系，请在批准之前将建议的更改与您保存的参考进行比较。","All":"全部","All guides":"所有指南","Also prepare a physical comparison when sizing matters. Measure a garment, shoe or bag you already own and know well. Use the same points that you will ask the warehouse to measure. Seller charts can guide selection, but warehouse measurements and your familiar item create a more useful comparison than size letters alone.":"当尺寸很重要时，还要准备物理比较。测量您已经拥有并熟悉的衣服、鞋子或包包。使用与您要求仓库测量相同的点。卖家图表可以指导选择，但仓库测量和您熟悉的商品可以比单独的尺寸字母进行更有用的比较。","Approve with a checklist,":"批准清单，","Approve: the evidence meets the acceptance threshold.":"批准：证据满足接受阈值。","Are spreadsheet prices the final amount paid?":"电子表格价格是最终支付的金额吗？","Articles":"文章","Ask for measurements only when the answer could change your decision.":"仅当答案可能改变您的决定时才要求测量。","At the final quote, compare like with like. Confirm the destination, parcel weight and dimensions, accepted contents, estimated service range, tracking level, insurance or compensation options and what happens during customs or last-mile delivery. The official “as fast as five days” wording describes a best-case option, not a universal transit time. Seller delay, warehouse processing, carrier handoff, customs and local delivery are separate clocks.":"在最后的报价中，进行同类比较。确认目的地、包裹重量和尺寸、接受的内容、预计服务范围、跟踪级别、保险或赔偿选项以及海关或最后一英里交付期间发生的情况。官方的“最快五天”措辞描述了最佳情况的选择，而不是通用的运输时间。卖方延迟、仓库处理、承运人交接、海关和本地交付是单独的时钟。","BUILD":"建造","Back to top ↑":"返回顶部 ↑","Bags":"包","Before looking for crooked stitching or tiny surface marks, confirm that the item is the one you ordered. Match the order number, visible size label, color, quantity and version. A beautifully made product in the wrong size is still a failed order. When a listing contains several similar options, compare the distinctive details saved at checkout: trim color, pocket layout, model code, sole pattern or included accessory.":"在寻找弯曲的缝线或微小的表面痕迹之前，请确认该商品是您订购的商品。匹配订单号、可见尺码标签、颜色、数量和版本。制作精美但尺寸错误的产品仍然是失败的订单。当列表包含多个类似选项时，请比较结帐时保存的独特详细信息：装饰颜色、口袋布局、型号代码、鞋底图案或随附配件。","Before parcel submission, list fragile, battery-powered, liquid, magnetic or otherwise restricted characteristics. The exact categories and accepted routes can change. Filter by destination and contents first, then compare price, tracking, compensation terms and delivery estimate. The cheapest headline rate is irrelevant if the line cannot accept the parcel or does not provide the service level you need.":"在提交包裹之前，请列出易碎、电池供电、液体、磁性或其他限制特性。确切的类别和接受的路线可能会发生变化。首先按目的地和内容进行过滤，然后比较价格、追踪、补偿条款和交货预估。如果该线路无法接受包裹或无法提供您所需的服务水平，那么最便宜的总体费率就无关紧要了。","Before placing the order, separate the budget into layers: product price, seller-to-warehouse delivery, optional warehouse services, packing choices, international freight and any destination tax or duty that may apply. Payment processing and currency conversion can add another difference. Hipobuy does not publish one universal delivered-price formula because a parcel does not exist when the product is first purchased.":"下订单之前，将预算分为几层：产品价格、卖方到仓库的交货、可选的仓库服务、包装选择、国际运费以及可能适用的任何目的地税或关税。付款处理和货币兑换可以增加另一个差异。 Hipobuy 没有发布通用的交货价格公式，因为首次购买产品时包裹不存在。","Before you open":"打开之前","Begin route selection with destination and contents, not the cheapest number. Batteries, liquids, magnets, powders, fragile goods and other restricted categories may have fewer eligible lines. Branded or sensitive goods can also be treated differently by a carrier or destination. Definitions and acceptance rules change, so use the current platform description and ask support about the exact item when classification is unclear.":"从目的地和内容开始选择路线，而不是最便宜的号码。电池、液体、磁铁、粉末、易碎品和其他受限类别的合格品类可能较少。承运商或目的地也可能以不同方式对待品牌或敏感商品。定义和接受规则发生变化，因此请使用当前的平台描述，并在分类不清楚时向支持人员询问确切的项目。","Browse Hipobuy product categories.":"浏览 Hipobuy 产品类别。","Build a realistic total":"建立一个现实的总数","Build a shipping estimate from the right inputs.":"根据正确的输入建立运输估算。","Build low, expected and high scenarios":"构建低、预期和高场景","Build the budget in layers":"分层制定预算","C01 · START HERE":"C01 · 从这里开始","C02 · QC PHOTOS":"C02·质检照片","C03 · COSTS":"C03 · 成本","CATEGORY":"类别","CHARGEABLE WEIGHT":"计费重量","Can this sheet predict Hipobuy shipping cost?":"这个表可以预测 Hipobuy 运费吗？","Categories":"类别","Category":"类别","Check color, size, quantity, version and included components.":"检查颜色、尺寸、数量、版本和包含的组件。","Check for stains, scratches, dents, glue marks, loose threads, missing pieces and packaging damage.":"检查是否有污渍、划痕、凹痕、胶痕、松线、缺失件和包装损坏。","Check the less photogenic surfaces too: underside, edges, inner labels, both pieces of a pair and detachable components. If packaging itself is damaged, distinguish cosmetic packaging damage from damage to the item. A crushed box may matter to a collector and not to another buyer, while removing a box can reduce parcel volume but reduce protection. The decision belongs to the person paying to ship it.":"还要检查不太上镜的表面：底面、边缘、内部标签、成对的两部分和可拆卸的组件。如果包装本身损坏，请区分化妆品包装损坏和物品损坏。被压碎的盒子可能对收藏者来说很重要，但对其他买家来说并不重要，而移除盒子可以减少包裹体积，但会减少保护。决定权属于支付运费的人。","Check variants, measurements, construction and visible damage in order.":"按顺序检查变型、尺寸、结构和可见损坏。","Checked":"已检查","Checked product rows.":"检查产品行。","Choose one of four clear outcomes":"选择四个明确结果之一","Classic loose-fit sweatshirt":"经典宽松运动衫","Closures, straps, soles and other stress points.":"封口、带子、鞋底和其他受力点。","Collared patchwork sweatshirt":"有领拼布运动衫","Color across more than one angle.":"跨多个角度着色。","Color needs care. Warehouse lighting, camera processing and your screen can shift a shade. Compare several views, use white or neutral objects in the frame as a rough reference, and look at areas under different reflections. A slight difference on one image is weak evidence. A large and consistent difference across several images is a reason to ask for confirmation.":"颜色需要护理。仓库照明、相机处理和屏幕都可以改变色调。比较多个视图，使用框架中的白色或中性物体作为粗略参考，并查看不同反射下的区域。一张图像上的微小差异是微弱的证据。多个图像之间存在巨大且一致的差异是要求确认的原因。","Compare dimensions with an item that already fits.":"将尺寸与已经合适的物品进行比较。","Compare the photographed color, size label, selected version and quantity with the order record before judging appearance.":"将拍下的颜色、尺码标签、所选版型、数量与订单记录进行对比，再判断外观。","Confirm color, size and selected version first.":"首先确认颜色、尺寸和所选版本。","Confirm the source page and intended variant are still available.":"确认源页面和预期变体仍然可用。","Consolidate and choose packaging deliberately":"精心整合和选择包装","Consolidation can reduce duplicated packing and make one international submission easier to manage, but it is not automatically cheaper in every combination. Mixed contents can change route eligibility. Large shoe boxes and rigid gift packaging can increase parcel volume; removing them may reduce chargeable weight but also removes protection. Decide what matters for each item rather than using a universal “remove all packaging” rule.":"合并可以减少重复包装，并使国际提交的文件更易于管理，但并不是每种组合都会自动更便宜。混合内容可能会改变路线资格。大鞋盒和硬质礼品包装可以增加包裹体积；移除它们可能会减少充电重量，但也会失去保护。决定每件物品的重要性，而不是使用通用的“去除所有包装”规则。","Consolidation may remove duplicate outer packaging and make tracking simpler. It does not guarantee the lowest freight cost. Mixed contents can reduce route eligibility, while bulky products can increase dimensional weight. Before combining items, decide whether fragile goods need separation, whether original boxes matter and whether one restricted item would force the entire parcel onto a more expensive route.":"合并可以去除重复的外包装并使跟踪更简单。它不保证最低的运费。混合内容会降低路线资格，而大件产品会增加尺寸重量。在合并物品之前，请确定易碎物品是否需要分开，原包装箱是否重要，以及一件受限制的物品是否会迫使整个包裹走上更昂贵的路线。","Construction":"建造","Content restrictions and declaration requirements.":"内容限制和声明要求。","Copy the option name exactly as it appears on the live listing.":"准确复制实时列表中显示的选项名称。","Count all components that the paid option actually includes. A seller’s promotional photo may show a complete set even when the selected variant contains one part. Compare with the order line, not the hero image. If an accessory is expected but absent from every warehouse image, ask whether it was received before approval.":"计算付费选项实际包含的所有组件。即使所选变体包含一个零件，卖家的宣传照片也可能显示整套。与订单线进行比较，而不是与英雄图像进行比较。如果需要配件但每个仓库图像中都没有，请询​​问是否在批准前收到。","Current Hipobuy website and official Apple App Store and Google Play descriptions. Third-party review platforms are used only for reported themes, never as proof of a typical result.":"当前 Hipobuy 网站以及官方 Apple App Store 和 Google Play 说明。第三方评论平台仅用于报告的主题，绝不作为典型结果的证明。","Customer reviews can reveal questions worth asking, but they do not prove a typical outcome. Current public feedback about Hipobuy includes positive reports about ease of use, support and QC photos, alongside complaints about refunds, shipping cost and support. Trustpilot currently shows the company’s rating as unavailable because of a guidelines breach and says it removed fake reviews. That moderation notice is a reason to treat both praise and criticism carefully, not a reason to select whichever anecdote confirms a preferred conclusion.":"客户评论可以揭示值得提出的问题，但它们并不能证明典型的结果。目前关于 Hipobuy 的公众反馈包括关于易用性、支持和质量控制照片的积极报告，以及关于退款、运输成本和支持的投诉。 Trustpilot 目前显示该公司因违反准则而被评级为不可用，并表示已删除虚假评论。适度通知是谨慎对待赞扬和批评的理由，而不是选择证实首选结论的轶事的理由。","DIRECT ROUTES":"直达航线","Daily runner · 58":"每日跑步 · 58","Damage & extras":"损坏及附加","Decide which facts are essential and which are preferences. Essential checks may include a size label, a pair rather than one piece, a required accessory or a measurement needed for fit. Preferences might include the exact fold of packaging or a harmless thread end. Writing these priorities in advance makes it easier to judge the received item consistently instead of reacting to whichever photo looks most dramatic.":"确定哪些事实是必要的，哪些是偏好。必要的检查可能包括尺寸标签、一对而不是一件、所需的配件或合身所需的尺寸。偏好可能包括包装的精确折叠或无害的线端。提前写下这些优先事项可以更轻松地一致地判断收到的物品，而不是对看起来最引人注目的照片做出反应。","Decision record":"决策记录","Decision rule: the order should survive more than the best case.":"决策规则：订单应该比最好的情况更有效。","Destination coverage and postcode limitations.":"目的地覆盖范围和邮政编码限制。","Directory preview":"目录预览","Do not add an unresolved item to a shipping parcel. Once international shipping begins, correction is harder and usually more expensive. If several items are in storage, give each a simple status and only consolidate approved lines. Hipobuy currently advertises 90 days of free storage in its official app descriptions, but confirm the live account rules and arrival dates before relying on the full period.":"请勿将未解决的项目添加到运输包裹中。一旦国际运输开始，纠正就更困难，而且通常更昂贵。如果存储了多个项目，请为每个项目提供一个简单的状态，并仅合并批准的行。 Hipobuy 目前在其官方应用程序描述中宣传 90 天的免费存储，但在依赖完整期限之前请先确认真实账户规则和到达日期。","Do not ask warehouse photos to prove authenticity or long-term durability.":"不要要求仓库照片来证明真实性或长期耐用性。","Do not collect numbers for their own sake. Extra measurements cost time and may cost a service fee under the live platform terms. Select the dimensions that answer “would I still ship this?” If the answer remains yes across a sensible range, another photograph is unlikely to add value.":"不要为了数字本身而收集数字。根据实时平台条款，额外的测量需要时间，并且可能会产生服务费。选择回答“我还会运送这个吗？”的尺寸。如果在合理范围内答案仍然是肯定的，那么另一张照片不太可能增加价值。","Do not promise delivery dates from an estimate.":"不要根据预估来承诺交货日期。","Do not use storage to postpone a known problem. Resolve QC, exchanges and returns while seller options remain available. Give every warehouse line a status—approved, waiting for evidence, exchange or return—and only pack approved items. A tidy warehouse plan reduces the chance of paying international shipping for the wrong variant or an item you had not inspected.":"不要使用存储来推迟已知问题。解决质量控制、换货和退货问题，同时保留卖家的选择权。为每个仓库线提供一个状态（已批准、等待证据、交换或退货），并且仅包装批准的物品。整洁的仓库计划可以减少为错误型号或未检查的物品支付国际运费的机会。","Do product photographs replace warehouse QC photos?":"产品照片可以代替仓库QC照片吗？","Does Hipobuy ship to more than 200 countries?":"Hipobuy 是否向 200 多个国家/地区发货？","Does it serve 200+ countries?":"它为 200 多个国家/地区提供服务吗？","Does ‘delivery in as fast as 5 days’ mean my parcel will arrive in five days?":"“最快 5 天送达”是否意味着我的包裹将在五天内到达？","Domestic shipping is easy to overlook because it appears before the item reaches the warehouse. International freight is usually quoted later because the system needs the parcel’s destination, contents, weight and dimensions. Customs charges depend on destination rules and declared parcel information; copying another buyer’s tax result is not a reliable calculation for yours.":"国内运输很容易被忽视，因为它出现在商品到达仓库之前。国际运费通常稍后报价，因为系统需要包裹的目的地、内容、重量和尺寸。海关费用取决于目的地规则和申报的包裹信息；复制其他买家的纳税结果对于您来说并不是一个可靠的计算。","Each route opens the matching live category. Confirm the current listing before making a decision.":"每条路线都会打开匹配的直播类别。在做出决定之前确认当前列表。","Electronics":"电子产品","End every review with approve, request evidence, exchange or return. Approval means the visible evidence is sufficient for your standards; it does not mean the platform guaranteed every hidden quality. Request evidence when one answer could change the choice. Exchange or return when the received item materially differs from the paid order or fails a threshold you set in advance.":"以批准、索取证据、交换或退货结束每次审核。批准意味着可见的证据足以满足您的标准；这并不意味着平台保证每一个隐藏的品质。当一个答案可能改变选择时索要证据。当收到的商品与已付款的订单存在重大差异或未达到您预先设置的阈值时，进行换货或退货。","Estimate consolidated contents, protective packing and whether boxes materially increase dimensions.":"估计合并内容、保护性包装以及盒子是否大幅增加尺寸。","Everyday trainer · 59":"日常训练师 · 59","Everyday trainer · 60":"日常训练师 · 60","Exchange: the seller can replace a material mismatch.":"换货：卖家可以更换材料不匹配的情况。","Expected: realistic packing and an acceptable service level.":"预期：真实的包装和可接受的服务水平。","FACTS REVIEWED · 22 AUG 2026":"事实审查 · 2026 年 8 月 22 日","FAQ":"常问问题","FINAL":"最终的","FIRST":"第一的","FIT":"合身","Fact-checked editorial sequence":"经过事实核查的编辑顺序","Fact-checked · reviewed 22 Aug 2026":"事实核查 · 审核日期：2026 年 8 月 22 日","Filter for destination, item type and restrictions before comparing speed or headline price.":"在比较速度或总体价格之前，先筛选目的地、商品类型和限制。","Filter products by category":"按类别过滤产品","Filter route eligibility before comparing price":"在比较价格之前过滤路线资格","Final quote":"最终报价","Finally compare service, not only price. Read the available tracking level, insurance or compensation terms, delivery scope and exclusions. A modest saving may not be worthwhile for a high-value or time-sensitive parcel. Likewise, paying for a faster estimate does not guarantee customs or last-mile speed. The cheapest route that accepts the contents and fits your risk tolerance is a real option; an ineligible headline rate is not.":"最后比较服务，而不仅仅是价格。阅读可用的跟踪级别、保险或赔偿条款、交付范围和排除情况。对于高价值或时间敏感的包裹来说，少量节省可能不值得。同样，支付更快的估价并不能保证海关或最后一英里的速度。接受内容并适合您的风险承受能力的最便宜的路线是一个真正的选择；不合格的标题利率则不是。","Find products by category, open the exact listing and use a repeatable QC checklist before anything leaves the warehouse.":"按类别查找产品，打开确切的清单，并在产品离开仓库之前使用可重复的质量控制检查表。","Finish with a clear outcome: approve, request evidence, exchange or return. Do not submit the parcel while an item is unresolved. Return eligibility and cost can depend on the seller and timing, so check the live terms quickly. Save the QC photos and your reason for the decision; they form the evidence chain between the seller listing and what you chose to ship.":"以明确的结果结束：批准、索取证据、交换或退货。请勿在物品未解决时提交包裹。退货资格和费用可能取决于卖家和时间，因此请快速查看实时条款。保存 QC 照片和您的决定理由；它们形成了卖家列表和您选择运送的物品之间的证据链。","First: match the ordered variant and quantity.":"第一：匹配订购的型号和数量。","For clothing, check panel alignment, collar and cuff symmetry, seam paths, print or embroidery placement, pockets and visible loose construction. For shoes, compare both members of the pair, toe shape, sole joins, heel alignment, stitching and size labels. For bags, inspect handles, strap attachments, zippers, corners and hardware. For electronics or accessories, confirm the model, plug or connector and included parts; a still photo cannot establish battery life or full functionality.":"对于服装，检查面板对齐、衣领和袖口对称性、接缝路径、印花或刺绣位置、口袋和可见的宽松结构。对于鞋子，比较一双鞋的两个成员、脚趾形状、鞋底连接、鞋跟对齐、缝线和尺码标签。对于包包，检查手柄、带子附件、拉链、边角和硬件。对于电子产品或配件，确认型号、插头或连接器以及随附的零件；静态照片无法确定电池寿命或全部功能。","Good order notes are short, specific and observable. State the exact color or size, identify a required accessory, or ask the buyer to confirm a particular listing option. Avoid phrases such as “best quality,” “perfect pair” or “make sure it fits.” An agent cannot verify a subjective standard or predict fit from a vague sentence. If a dimension is critical, name the measurement and where it should be taken.":"好的订单注释是简短、具体且可观察的。说明确切的颜色或尺寸，确定所需的配件，或要求买家确认特定的列表选项。避免使用诸如“最好的质量”、“完美的配对”或“确保它合适”之类的短语。代理人无法验证主观标准或从模糊的句子中预测适合性。如果尺寸很重要，请指定测量值以及测量位置。","HB-5970":"HB-5970","HB-5971":"HB-5971","HB-5974":"HB-5974","HB-6043":"HB-6043","HB-6044":"HB-6044","HB-6045":"HB-6045","Headwear":"头饰","High: larger chargeable weight or reduced route choice.":"高：计费重量较大或路线选择减少。","Hipobuy":"嗨波买","Hipobuy Guides 2026: Buying, QC Photos & Shipping":"Hipobuy 指南 2026：购买、QC 照片和运输","Hipobuy Product Categories 2026: Shoes, Clothing & More":"Hipobuy 产品类别 2026：鞋子、服装等","Hipobuy QC Photos Guide 2026: A Warehouse Checklist":"Hipobuy QC 照片指南 2026：仓库清单","Hipobuy QC Photos: What to Check Before Warehouse Approval":"Hipobuy QC 照片：仓库批准前要检查的内容","Hipobuy Sheet home":"Hipobuy 床单首页","Hipobuy Shipping Cost 2026: Build a Realistic Total":"Hipobuy 2026 年运费：建立切合实际的总计","Hipobuy Shipping Cost Guide 2026: Weight, Packing & Routes":"Hipobuy 2026 年运输成本指南：重量、包装和路线","Hipobuy Spreadsheet 2026":"Hipobuy 电子表格 2026","Hipobuy Spreadsheet 2026: Product Finds, QC & Shipping Guide":"Hipobuy 电子表格 2026：产品查找、质量控制和运输指南","Hipobuy Spreadsheet FAQ 2026":"Hipobuy 电子表格常见问题解答 2026","Hipobuy currently advertises 90 days of free storage in its official app listings. That can give orders from different sellers time to reach the warehouse before one parcel is submitted. Confirm the current live terms, the date each item entered storage and what happens after the free period. A marketing headline should never replace the account-level countdown.":"Hipobuy 目前在其官方应用程序列表中宣传 90 天的免费存储空间。这可以让不同卖家的订单在提交一个包裹之前有时间到达仓库。确认当前的有效条款、每个项目进入存储的日期以及免费期后会发生什么。营销标题永远不应取代帐户级倒计时。","Hipobuy describes itself as a global shopping app that helps customers buy products from China, including listings on Taobao and 1688, and then arrange international delivery. In practical terms, this is an agent workflow rather than a normal local-store checkout. The seller sends the item to a warehouse in China; the warehouse receives it; you review the available evidence; and only then do you submit an international parcel. Those stages create useful checkpoints, but they also mean the first product payment is not the final delivered cost.":"Hipobuy将自己描述为一款全球购物应用程序，帮助客户从中国购买产品，包括淘宝和1688上的商品，然后安排国际送货。实际上，这是一个代理工作流程，而不是正常的本地商店结账流程。卖家将商品发送至中国的仓库；仓库接收；您审查现有证据；然后您才可以提交国际包裹。这些阶段创建了有用的检查点，但它们也意味着首次产品付款并不是最终的交付成本。","Hipobuy describes itself as a global shopping app that helps users purchase products from Chinese marketplaces such as Taobao and 1688, then arrange international shipping. It is an intermediary workflow, not the manufacturer of the products shown in seller listings.":"Hipobuy将自己描述为一款全球购物应用程序，帮助用户从淘宝和1688等中国市场购买产品，然后安排国际运输。这是一个中间工作流程，而不是卖家列表中显示的产品的制造商。","Hipobuy guides built around decisions—not slogans.":"Hipobuy 指南围绕决策而非口号构建。","Hipobuy’s current official app descriptions say the service ships to more than 200 countries, offers thousands of shipping options and has delivery choices described as being as fast as five days. They also advertise 90 days of free warehouse storage. These claims help explain the platform’s intended scope, but none is a universal shipping quote. A route to one country may reject the contents, disappear at a certain weight or use a different price structure from a route with a similar name.":"Hipobuy 目前的官方应用程序描述称，该服务可向 200 多个国家/地区发货，提供数千种运输选项，并且交付选项据称最快可达五天。他们还宣传 90 天免费仓库存储。这些声明有助于解释该平台的预期范围，但没有一个是通用的运输报价。前往一个国家/地区的路线可能会拒绝其中的内容，以一定的重量消失或使用与名称相似的路线不同的价格结构。","Hipobuy’s official app descriptions market the service as a way to buy products from Chinese platforms such as Taobao and 1688 and ship them internationally. The warehouse stage is therefore a decision gate inside a longer agent workflow. It reduces visible risk; it does not remove seller, sizing, route or customs risk. Approach QC as a repeatable inspection, not as a gallery of attractive photos.":"Hipobuy 的官方应用程序描述将该服务推销为一种从淘宝和 1688 等中国平台购买产品并将其运送到国际的方式。因此，仓库阶段是较长代理工作流程中的决策门。它降低了可见风险；它并不能消除卖家、尺码、路线或海关风险。将质量控制视为可重复的检查，而不是视为有吸引力的照片库。","Home ↑":"首页 ↑","Hoodies":"连帽衫","Hoodies/Sweaters":"连帽衫/毛衣","How to Buy with Hipobuy in 2026: Product Link to Delivery":"2026 年如何通过 Hipobuy 购买：产品链接到交付","How to buy with Hipobuy":"如何使用 Hipobuy 购买","ID":"ID","ITEM":"物品","If a purchase is only affordable when every low-case assumption succeeds, reduce the basket or wait for better information. An attractive product price can hide an uneconomic delivered total, especially for large, low-value goods. The purpose of a budget worksheet is not to make the shipping look cheap; it is to expose the decision before the parcel becomes difficult to change.":"如果只有在所有低案例假设都成功时才可以负担得起购买，请减少购物篮或等待更好的信息。有吸引力的产品价格可能会掩盖不经济的交付总量，尤其是对于大件、低价值的商品。预算工作表的目的不是让运费看起来便宜；而是让运费看起来便宜。就是在包裹变得难以改变之前公开决定。","If the live workflow offers rehearsal or pre-packing, consider it when dimensions could materially affect the quote. Use the warehouse measurements, not a social-media parcel with different contents. Some routes charge actual weight while others compare it with a volumetric calculation. Divisors, rounding and minimum billable increments vary, so only the current route quote can settle the comparison.":"如果实时工作流程提供排练或预包装，请在尺寸可能对报价产生重大影响时考虑。使用仓库测量数据，而不是包含不同内容的社交媒体包裹。有些路线收取实际重量，而另一些路线则将其与体积计算进行比较。除数、四舍五入和最小计费增量各不相同，因此只有当前航线报价才能进行比较。","Images can make a future review analysis more persuasive when they are evidence rather than decoration: dated screenshots of official terms, anonymised parcel invoices with weight and route visible, QC examples with permission, and charts showing review themes and time periods. Every image should have a descriptive caption, useful alt text, provenance and any necessary permission. Do not use a random parcel photo to imply it represents a verified customer outcome.":"当图像作为证据而不是装饰时，可以使未来的评论分析更有说服力：官方条款的日期截图、重量和路线可见的匿名包裹发票、经许可的质量控制示例以及显示评论主题和时间段的图表。每张图片都应该有描述性标题、有用的替代文本、出处和任何必要的许可。请勿使用随机包裹照片来暗示其代表经过验证的客户结果。","Independent product directory · 2026 edition":"独立产品目录·2026年版","Independent product-discovery and education resource. Not affiliated with Hipobuy or the marketplaces referenced by product listings.":"独立的产品发现和教育资源。不隶属于 Hipobuy 或产品列表引用的市场。","Independent product-discovery resource. Not affiliated with Hipobuy or the marketplaces referenced by product listings.":"独立的产品发现资源。不隶属于 Hipobuy 或产品列表引用的市场。","Inspect construction in a fixed order":"按固定顺序检查施工","International route charge from live parcel data.":"国际航线费用来自实时包裹数据。","International shipping cannot be reduced to one universal price. Destination, route, parcel dimensions, actual weight, item restrictions and optional services can all affect the quote.":"国际运输不能降低为一个通用价格。目的地、路线、包裹尺寸、实际重量、物品限制和可选服务都会影响报价。","Is 90-day storage advertised?":"广告上有 90 天的存储空间吗？","Is 90-day warehouse storage currently advertised?":"目前是否有广告宣传 90 天的仓库存储？","Is five-day delivery guaranteed?":"是否保证五天送达？","Is this the official Hipobuy website?":"这是 Hipobuy 的官方网站吗？","It means the destination page responded during the stated check. It does not prove that a variant is in stock, that the seller is reliable, that the product will match promotional photographs or that a shipping route will accept it.":"这意味着目标页面在规定的检查期间做出了响应。它并不能证明某个型号有库存、卖家是否可靠、该产品是否与促销照片相符或运输路线是否接受该产品。","Item subtotal":"项目小计","Its official app listings describe a shopping service for products from Chinese marketplaces, followed by international shipping.":"其官方应用程序列表描述了来自中国市场的产品购物服务，其次是国际运输。","Jackets":"夹克","Jersey":"球衣","Keep a screenshot when a visible detail materially affects the purchase.":"当可见细节对购买产生重大影响时，保留屏幕截图。","Keep evidence and read reviews critically":"保留证据并批判性地阅读评论","Keep international shipping outside this first checkout decision. The initial order sends the product to the warehouse, not to your home. A support estimate given before receipt may help with planning, but the better quote comes after the item is measured and packed. Clear separation between the product order and parcel order makes receipts easier to understand and disputes easier to document.":"将国际运输排除在第一个结账决定之外。初始订单会将产品发送到仓库，而不是您的家中。收货前给出的支持估算可能有助于规划，但更好的报价是在测量和包装物品后提供的。产品订单和包裹订单之间的明确区分使收据更容易理解，争议也更容易记录。","Keep the first product payment and later parcel payment as separate checkpoints in your records. This makes the delivered cost easier to audit and lets you compare future parcels. If the total is unexpectedly high, you can see whether the cause was product pricing, domestic delivery, packaging, chargeable weight, route selection or a destination charge instead of treating “shipping” as one unexplained number.":"将第一次产品付款和后来的包裹付款作为单独的检查点保存在您的记录中。这使得交付成本更容易审核，并让您可以比较未来的包裹。如果总数出乎意料地高，您可以查看原因是否是产品定价、国内配送、包装、计费重量、路线选择或目的地费用，而不是将“运费”视为一个无法解释的数字。","Keep the photos and note why you approved, requested another image, exchanged or returned the item.":"保留照片并注明您批准、请求另一张图片、交换或退回该商品的原因。","Know what the sheet can—and cannot—tell you.":"了解该表可以告诉您什么，不能告诉您什么。","Know what warehouse photos can prove":"了解仓库照片可以证明什么","LINK CHECKED":"链接已检查","LINK LIVE ↗":"直播链接 ↗","LINKS CHECKED · 22 AUG 2026":"已检查链接 · 2026 年 8 月 22 日","LIVE_INDEX.csv":"LIVE_INDEX.csv","Language":"语言","Last: decide and record approve, evidence, exchange or return.":"最后：决定并记录批准、取证、交换或退货。","Less wandering. More checking.":"少些流浪。更多检查。","Letter-embroidered cap":"字母刺绣帽","List two or three checks that could change the decision.":"列出两到三项可能改变决定的检查。","Live product sheet · links checked 22 Aug 2026":"实时产品表 · 已检查链接 2026 年 8 月 22 日","Look at the front, back, both sides and top. Check whether panels, prints, seams and paired items align consistently.":"看正面、背面、两侧和顶部。检查面板、印花、接缝和配对物品是否对齐。","Look beyond the largest price figure. Check the estimated service range, tracking, insurance or compensation choices and any excluded areas. Confirm the currency and whether payment processing changes the final amount. Save the quote and parcel details at submission. If a later adjustment occurs, you need the original inputs to understand it.":"超越最大的价格数字。检查估计的服务范围、跟踪、保险或补偿选择以及任何排除的区域。确认货币以及付款处理是否会更改最终金额。提交时保存报价和包裹详细信息。如果稍后发生调整，您需要原始输入才能理解它。","Look for marks, missing pieces and packaging issues.":"寻找标记、缺失件和包装问题。","Low: compact parcel and economical eligible route.":"低：紧凑的地块和经济的合格路线。","Marketplace photos describe a listing. Warehouse photos help verify the item that actually arrived.":"市场照片描述了列表。仓库照片有助于验证实际到达的物品。","Match the ordered variant first":"首先匹配订购的变体","Measure a known item using clearly defined points.":"使用明确定义的点测量已知项目。","Measurements":"测量值","No invented flat rates":"没有发明统一费率","No. A spreadsheet price is a dated product reference. A realistic total may also include domestic delivery to the warehouse, optional services, packing, payment or exchange effects and international shipping calculated from the completed parcel.":"不。电子表格价格是一份注明日期的产品参考。实际的总数还可能包括国内运送到仓库、可选服务、包装、付款或兑换效果以及根据完成的包裹计算的国际运输。","No. Seller images describe a listing. Warehouse photos can only document visible aspects of the item that arrived, such as color, labels, quantity, measurements and obvious damage. They cannot prove long-term durability, composition or fit on your body.":"不会。卖家图片描述的是列表。仓库照片只能记录到达物品的可见方面，例如颜色、标签、数量、尺寸和明显损坏。它们无法证明长期耐用性、成分或适合您的身体。","No. The official app listing uses ‘as fast as 5 days’ as a best-case shipping claim. It is not a universal delivery promise. Processing, route choice, carrier handoff, customs and last-mile delivery can all change the actual timeline.":"不会。官方应用程序列表使用“最快 5 天”作为最佳情况的运输索赔。这不是一个普遍的交付承诺。处理、路线选择、承运人交接、海关和最后一英里交付都可能改变实际的时间表。","No. This is an independent product-discovery and education resource. Platform policies, fees, storage rules, available routes and checkout terms can change, so confirm time-sensitive information in the live service before payment or parcel submission.":"不。这是一个独立的产品发现和教育资源。平台政策、费用、存储规则、可用路线和结账条款可能会发生变化，因此在付款或提交包裹之前，请在实时服务中确认时间敏感的信息。","No. ‘As fast as 5 days’ is a best-case marketing claim, not a promise for every route or parcel.":"不会。“最快 5 天”是最好的营销主张，而不是对每条路线或包裹的承诺。","ON THIS PAGE":"在本页","Official app descriptions mention buyers available around the clock, but a service claim should not be read as a guaranteed response time for every case. Use the order-specific support channel, include the relevant order or parcel number and ask one clear question. That gives the support team something concrete to trace.":"官方应用程序说明提到买家全天候可用，但服务声明不应被视为对每种情况都有保证的响应时间。使用特定于订单的支持渠道，提供相关订单或包裹编号，并提出一个明确的问题。这为支持团队提供了具体的可追踪信息。","Only as a planning range. The final quote needs destination, measured weight, parcel dimensions, contents, packing choices, route rules and current pricing. Compare routes only after confirming that each one is eligible for the parcel.":"仅作为规划范围。最终报价需要目的地、测量重量、包裹尺寸、内容、包装选择、路线规则和当前定价。仅在确认每条路线都符合包裹条件后才比较路线。","Only one angle is supplied for a three-dimensional item.":"对于三维项目仅提供一个角度。","Open Accessories on cnfanshp.com":"打开 cnfanshp.com 配件","Open Bags on cnfanshp.com":"cnfanshp.com 开袋","Open Electronics on cnfanshp.com":"cnfanshp.com 开放电子","Open Headwear on cnfanshp.com":"在cnfanshp.com上打开头饰","Open Hoodies/Sweaters on cnfanshp.com":"在cnfanshp.com上打开帽衫/毛衣","Open Jackets on cnfanshp.com":"cnfanshp.com 上的 Open Jackets","Open Jersey on cnfanshp.com":"在cnfanshp.com上打开球衣","Open Other Stuff on cnfanshp.com":"打开 cnfanshp.com 上的其他内容","Open Pants/Shorts on cnfanshp.com":"在cnfanshp.com上打开裤子/短裤","Open Shoes on cnfanshp.com":"cnfanshp.com 开鞋","Open T-shirts on cnfanshp.com":"在cnfanshp.com上打开T恤","Open Women on cnfanshp.com":"cnfanshp.com 开放女性","Open exact product":"打开确切的产品","Open full index":"打开完整索引","Open spreadsheet":"打开电子表格","Opening a focused category is only the first step. Confirm product options and inspect available warehouse photos before approving an item.":"开设重点类别只是第一步。在批准商品之前，请确认产品选项并检查可用的仓库照片。","Optional services and packing choices.":"可选服务和包装选择。","Order match":"订单匹配","Other Stuff":"其他东西","Overall shape and pair symmetry.":"整体形状和对对称性。","PRODUCT":"产品","Packaging changes dimensions as well as protection. Shoe boxes, rigid gift boxes, padded air space and awkward shapes may increase the billable volume. Removing packaging can reduce a quote, but it can also expose an item to compression, moisture or impact. A collector may value the original box; another buyer may prefer a smaller parcel. The correct choice depends on the item, route and tolerance for damage.":"包装改变了尺寸和保护。鞋盒、硬质礼品盒、带衬垫的空气空间和笨拙的形状可能会增加计费体积。去除包装可以减少报价，但也可能使物品受到压缩、潮湿或撞击。收藏家可能会看重原盒；另一位买家可能更喜欢较小的包裹。正确的选择取决于物品、路线和损坏容忍度。","Packaging only where it forms part of the purchase decision.":"仅在构成购买决策一部分的情况下进行包装。","Packing decisions trade volume against protection.":"包装决定贸易量免受保护。","Pants/Shorts":"长裤/短裤","Parcel build":"地块建造","Parcel weight and outer-dimension limits.":"包裹重量和外部尺寸限制。","Payment, currency, tax, duty or last-mile effects where applicable.":"付款、货币、税收、关税或最后一英里影响（如果适用）。","Photographed tape measurements have limitations. The tape may bend, begin outside the frame or sit at an angle. Fabric can be stretched or folded. A difference of a few millimetres may be measurement noise, while a large difference can justify a repeat image. Ask the warehouse to retake only the measurement that could change the decision and specify how.":"拍摄的卷尺测量有局限性。胶带可能会弯曲、从框架外部开始或以一定角度放置。织物可以拉伸或折叠。几毫米的差异可能是测量噪声，而大的差异则可以证明重复图像是合理的。要求仓库仅重新进行可能改变决定的测量并具体说明如何改变。","Platform facts can change. Each guide separates what the sheet shows from what must be confirmed at checkout.":"平台事实可能会发生变化。每份指南将表格显示的内容与结帐时必须确认的内容分开。","Prepare the reference before the item arrives":"在物品到达之前准备好参考资料","Preview data from the destination catalogue.":"预览目标目录中的数据。","Prices are dated references—not checkout quotes.":"价格为注明日期的参考价格，而非结帐报价。","Prices are reference conversions from a dated CNY snapshot. Recheck the current listing, selected variant, domestic delivery and checkout quote.":"价格是根据已注明日期的人民币快照进行的参考换算。重新检查当前列表、所选型号、国内交货和结账报价。","Primary navigation":"主要导航","Prints, embroidery, hardware and visible finish.":"印花、刺绣、五金配件和可见饰面。","Prioritize defects at high-stress or functional points. Loose construction at a handle attachment, zipper end or sole join matters more than a removable thread on an internal seam. Warehouse photographs are usually designed for a practical decision, not microscopic inspection. Ask for a close-up when the suspected issue could affect use, safety or whether you would keep the item.":"优先考虑高应力或功能点的缺陷。手柄附件、拉链末端或鞋底连接处的松散结构比内部接缝上的可拆卸螺纹更重要。仓库照片通常是为了实际决策而设计的，而不是微观检查。当可疑问题可能影响使用、安全或您是否会保留该物品时，要求进行特写。","Processing, carrier handoff, customs and last-mile delivery are separate stages. Keep the tracking record and allow for route-specific uncertainty.":"处理、承运人交接、海关和最后一英里交付是不同的阶段。保留跟踪记录并考虑到特定路线的不确定性。","Product and seller-to-warehouse delivery.":"产品和卖方到仓库的交付。","Product, category or ID":"产品、类别或 ID","Public Hipobuy reviews currently contain mixed shipping experiences. Some users report quick or straightforward delivery, while others complain about unexpectedly high international freight, refunds or support. These anecdotes can reveal which questions deserve clear answers, but they cannot provide a rate for your country, parcel or date. Reviewers rarely publish complete weight, dimensions, contents, route, discounts and destination charges.":"Hipobuy 的公开评论目前包含混合的运输体验。一些用户表示交货快捷或直接，而另一些用户则抱怨国际运费、退款或支持出乎意料地高。这些轶事可以揭示哪些问题值得明确答案，但它们无法提供您所在国家/地区、包裹或日期的费率。审阅者很少公布完整的重量、尺寸、内容、路线、折扣和目的地费用。","Public reviews are mixed: users report both easy ordering and fast delivery, as well as complaints about shipping cost, refunds and support. Trustpilot currently marks Hipobuy’s rating unavailable because of a guidelines breach and says it removed a number of fake reviews. Treat individual reviews as anecdotes, not proof of a typical outcome.":"公众评价褒贬不一：用户报告订购方便、交货快捷，以及对运输成本、退款和支持的投诉。 Trustpilot 目前将 Hipobuy 的评级标记为不可用，因为它违反了准则，并表示它删除了一些虚假评论。将个人评论视为轶事，而不是典型结果的证据。","QC":"质量控制","QC PHOTOS":"质量控制照片","QC guide":"质检指南","Quantity, pairs and detachable components.":"数量、成对和可拆卸组件。","Quick answers about prices, link checks, QC evidence and shipping estimates.":"有关价格、链接检查、质量控制证据和运输估算的快速答案。","READ ARTICLE →":"阅读文章 →","REQUEST AN EXTRA PHOTO WHEN":"索取额外照片","Read QC photos in the same order, every time.":"每次都以相同的顺序读取 QC 照片。","Read all FAQs →":"阅读所有常见问题解答 →","Read before opening a row.":"打开一行之前先阅读。","Read guide":"阅读指南","Read the full QC guide":"阅读完整的质量控制指南","Read the live quote like an invoice":"像阅读发票一样阅读实时报价","Read warehouse photos":"阅读仓库照片","Record details that would be difficult to reconstruct later. Save the product URL, selected variant, quantity and any feature that materially affects your decision. If the seller image shows several pieces, verify that the chosen option includes all of them. If the product is described through a batch code or version name, copy that wording into your note. This small record becomes the reference for warehouse inspection.":"记录以后难以重建的细节。保存产品 URL、所选型号、数量以及对您的决定产生重大影响的任何功能。如果卖家图片显示多件，请验证所选选项是否包含所有件。如果通过批次代码或版本名称描述产品，请将该措辞复制到您的注释中。这份小记录成为仓库检查的参考。","Record the current listing price, selected variant and any domestic delivery to the warehouse.":"记录当前的挂牌价格、选定的型号以及任何国内交货到仓库的情况。","Record the expected quantity and components.":"记录预期数量和成分。","Request evidence: one targeted answer is missing.":"索取证据：缺少一个有针对性的答案。","Request or inspect useful measurements and compare them with a garment or item that already fits—not only a generic size chart.":"请求或检查有用的尺寸，并将其与已经合身的服装或物品进行比较，而不仅仅是通用尺码表。","Research basis · checked 22 Aug 2026":"研究依据 · 2026 年 8 月 22 日检查","Return: do not ship the item internationally.":"退货：不向国际运送该商品。","Review symmetry, stitching, edges and hardware.":"检查对称性、缝合、边缘和硬件。","Review the order line before payment. Links can open with a default variant that differs from the spreadsheet image. Check quantity, variant, seller price and domestic delivery. If the product uses seller sizing, compare its current chart with a similar item you own rather than relying on a familiar size letter. A size marked L on one listing may have very different dimensions from an L elsewhere.":"付款前查看订单行。链接可以使用与电子表格图像不同的默认变体打开。检查数量、型号、卖家价格和国内交货。如果产品使用卖家尺码，请将其当前图表与您拥有的类似商品进行比较，而不是依赖熟悉的尺码字母。某商品上标记为 L 的尺寸可能与其他地方标记为 L 的尺寸有很大不同。","Route eligibility":"路线资格","SHEET":"床单","SHIPPING":"船运","SHIPPING COST":"运费","START HERE":"从这里开始","STATUS":"地位","Save the live listing and paid variant.":"保存实时列表和付费版本。","Save the seller reference, paid variant, warehouse images, extra-photo requests and final decision. If a refund, exchange or parcel issue occurs, dated records provide a usable sequence. They also improve your next purchase: you learn which measurements mattered, which packaging added volume and which listing details were easy to misunderstand.":"保存卖家参考信息、付费版本、仓库图片、额外照片请求和最终决定。如果发生退款、换货或包裹问题，带日期的记录会提供可用的序列。它们还可以改善您的下一次购买：您了解哪些尺寸很重要，哪些包装增加了体积以及哪些列表细节容易被误解。","Scope note":"范围说明","Seams, joins, edges and alignment.":"接缝、连接、边缘和对齐。","Search a compact preview, compare dated USD references and open the exact destination page. A live link does not guarantee stock, seller quality or final shipping cost.":"搜索紧凑预览，比较过时的美元参考并打开确切的目标页面。实时链接不能保证库存、卖家质量或最终运费。","Search rows":"搜索行","Search the main catalogue":"搜索主目录","Search ↗":"搜索 ↗","Second: compare essential measurements.":"第二：比较基本测量结果。","Separate damage from glare, dust and compression":"隔离眩光、灰尘和压缩造成的损坏","Separate every layer of delivered cost":"分离每一层交付成本","Separate item price, domestic delivery and international chargeable weight.":"单独的商品价格、国内配送和国际计费重量。","Shape & symmetry":"形状与对称性","Shipping":"船运","Shoes":"鞋","Shoes, hoodie, product ID…":"鞋子、连帽衫、产品 ID……","Size label and model or version code.":"尺寸标签和型号或版本代码。","Some routes charge the larger of the parcel’s measured weight and a dimensional calculation. The divisor and rounding method can vary, so use the live estimator for the selected route rather than copying a rate from another parcel.":"有些路线按包裹的测量重量和尺寸计算中较大者收取费用。除数和舍入方法可能会有所不同，因此请使用所选路线的实时估算器，而不是复制另一个地块的费率。","Spreadsheet":"电子表格","Start with a shelf,":"从架子开始，","Start with product intent instead of scrolling a mixed list. Every card opens the corresponding category or search result on the main catalogue.":"从产品意图开始，而不是滚动混合列表。每张卡片都会在主目录上打开相应的类别或搜索结果。","Start with the exact live product link":"从确切的实时产品链接开始","Start with the full front, back and side views. Look for overall symmetry, twisted panels, uneven height, mismatched pair shape and obvious deformation. Then move inward to seams, edges, closures and hardware. A fixed order prevents a tiny cosmetic issue from distracting you from a more important structural mismatch.":"从完整的前视图、后视图和侧视图开始。检查整体对称、面板扭曲、高度不均、线对形状不匹配、变形明显。然后向内移动到接缝、边缘、闭合和硬件。固定的顺序可以防止微小的外观问题分散您对更重要的结构不匹配的注意力。","Start with what the official claims do—and do not—mean":"从官方声明的含义和不含义开始","Submit shipping and keep a complete record":"提交运输并保留完整记录","T-shirts":"T恤","That is the current official platform claim, but route eligibility still depends on destination, contents and parcel limits.":"这是目前官方平台的说法，但路线资格仍然取决于目的地、内容和包裹限制。","The current Apple App Store and Google Play descriptions say the service can deliver to more than 200 countries. That is a platform-level claim, not a guarantee that every route accepts every destination or item. Check live route eligibility for the actual parcel.":"目前 Apple App Store 和 Google Play 的描述称该服务可以向 200 多个国家提供服务。这是平台级声明，并不能保证每条路线都接受每个目的地或物品。检查实际包裹的实时路线资格。","The dependable Hipobuy workflow is not simply find and buy. It is discover, verify, specify, inspect, consolidate, quote and track. Each checkpoint answers a different question, and none removes all international-shopping risk. Used this way, a spreadsheet becomes a navigation tool rather than a promise, QC becomes evidence rather than decoration, and the live parcel quote becomes the basis for the shipping decision.":"可靠的 Hipobuy 工作流程不仅仅是查找和购买。它是发现、验证、指定、检查、合并、报价和跟踪。每个检查站都会回答不同的问题，但没有一个检查站可以消除所有国际购物风险。通过这种方式，电子表格成为导航工具而不是承诺，质量控制成为证据而不是装饰，实时包裹报价成为运输决策的基础。","The first three articles follow the order a new buyer actually needs: understand the complete buying workflow, learn to read warehouse evidence, then calculate a realistic delivered cost. Official claims are labelled and third-party reviews are treated as anecdotes.":"前三篇文章遵循新买家实际需要的顺序：了解完整的购买工作流程，学习阅读仓库证据，然后计算实际的交付成本。官方声明被贴上标签，第三方评论被视为轶事。","The live route determines the divisor, rounding and billable rule.":"实时路由决定除数、舍入和计费规则。","The most reliable answer to “How much is Hipobuy shipping?” remains conditional: it depends on destination, contents, packed weight and dimensions, route rules and current pricing. Use public reports to identify risks, warehouse data to improve the estimate and the live quote to choose. That is less exciting than a universal number, but it is the only method that respects how international parcel pricing actually works.":"“Hipobuy 运费是多少？”最可靠的答案仍然是有条件的：取决于目的地、内容、包装重量和尺寸、路线规则和当前定价。使用公开报告来识别风险，使用仓库数据来改进估算，并使用实时报价来进行选择。这不像通用数字那么令人兴奋，但它是尊重国际包裹定价实际运作方式的唯一方法。","The official app descriptions currently advertise international shipping to more than 200 countries, 90 days of free storage and delivery options described as being as fast as five days. Read those as platform claims, not as promises for every buyer. Destination, parcel contents, route availability, seller dispatch, customs and local delivery can all change the outcome. Before spending money, open the live site or app and confirm that your country, product type and preferred payment method are currently supported.":"官方应用程序描述目前宣传国际运输至 200 多个国家/地区，90 天免费存储和交付选项，据称最快可达 5 天。将这些视为平台声明，而不是对每个买家的承诺。目的地、包裹内容、路线可用性、卖家发货、海关和当地交付都可能改变结果。在花钱之前，请打开实时网站或应用程序并确认当前支持您所在的国家/地区、产品类型和首选付款方式。","The phrase “as fast as five days” is best-case marketing language, not a promised door-to-door result for every parcel. Seller dispatch, warehouse receipt, packing, carrier collection, export handling, customs and local delivery happen in separate stages. A fast line cannot erase time spent before carrier handoff or during inspection. Use the current route estimate shown for your packed parcel, and still treat it as a range.":"“最快五天”这句话是最好的营销语言，而不是承诺每个包裹都能送货上门。卖方发货、仓单、包装、承运人托收、出口处理、海关和当地交付分别发生在不同的阶段。快速线路无法消除承运人交接之前或检查期间所花费的时间。使用为您的包装包裹显示的当前路线估计，并仍将其视为一个范围。","The strongest QC review begins at ordering, not at warehouse receipt. Save the exact seller link, selected variant, quantity and any listing detail that affects acceptance. Screenshots are useful when sellers edit pages or replace images. If there are several batches, colors or bundles on one listing, record the wording shown in the paid order rather than relying on memory.":"最严格的质量控制审查从订购开始，而不是从仓单开始。保存准确的卖家链接、所选款式、数量以及影响接受的任何列表详细信息。当卖家编辑页面或替换图像时，屏幕截图非常有用。如果一个清单上有多个批次、颜色或捆绑，请记录付款订单中显示的措辞，而不是依靠记忆。","The supplied view cannot answer a material question.":"所提供的观点无法回答实质性问题。","Then check weight and dimension limits. A route can appear during an early estimate but disappear after consolidation if the parcel exceeds a limit. Splitting a parcel may restore options but can duplicate base charges and create two customs movements. Combining everything may reduce duplicated packaging but push the parcel into volumetric pricing. Compare the actual alternatives shown in the live workflow.":"然后检查重量和尺寸限制。路线可能会在早期估算期间出现，但如果地块超出限制，则在合并后消失。拆分包裹可能会恢复选项，但可能会重复基本费用并产生两次海关变动。将所有内容结合起来可能会减少重复包装，但会将包裹推向体积定价。比较实时工作流程中显示的实际替代方案。","These answers separate current official platform statements from planning assumptions and third-party anecdotes. Live checkout and route terms always take priority.":"这些答案将当前的官方平台声明与规划假设和第三方轶事区分开来。实时结账和路线条款始终优先。","Third: inspect construction, symmetry and damage.":"第三：检查结构、对称性和损坏情况。","This guide therefore uses a simple rule: make a decision only with the evidence available at that stage. A directory can help you discover a product. The seller listing can confirm the current options. Warehouse photos can show the received item. A packed parcel can produce a useful shipping quote. Asking one stage to answer a later-stage question is how unrealistic expectations begin.":"因此，本指南使用一个简单的规则：仅根据该阶段可用的证据做出决定。目录可以帮助您发现产品。卖家列表可以确认当前选项。仓库照片可以显示收到的物品。包装好的包裹可以产生有用的运输报价。要求一个阶段回答稍后阶段的问题是不切实际的期望的开始。","This independent guide explains a decision process. Product availability, platform rules, services and shipping routes can change; confirm live terms before payment.":"本独立指南解释了决策过程。产品可用性、平台规则、服务和运输路线可能会发生变化；付款前确认实时条款。","This is also the point to decide whether one product is worth shipping alone. The advertised 90-day free-storage period can make consolidation possible, but do not interpret storage as a reason to keep buying indefinitely. Confirm the current storage terms in your account, note when each item arrived and keep enough budget for the eventual parcel. Storage solves timing; it does not remove international shipping cost.":"这也是决定一款产品是否值得单独发货的关键点。广告上宣传的 90 天免费存储期可以使整合成为可能，但不要将存储视为无限期继续购买的理由。确认您帐户中的当前存储条款，记下每件物品的到达时间，并为最终包裹保留足够的预算。存储解决时序；它不会消除国际运费。","Track seller dispatch and warehouse receipt":"跟踪卖家发货和仓单","Tracking, compensation, estimated range and last-mile scope.":"跟踪、补偿、估计范围和最后一英里范围。","Treat customer reports as signals, not rate cards":"将客户报告视为信号，而不是价目表","Treat every spreadsheet price as a dated reference. Chinese marketplace listings often group several colors, sizes, bundles or even different products on one page. The lowest visible number may belong to an accessory or a simpler variation. Sellers can also revise prices and domestic delivery charges. A difference between a directory and the live listing is not automatically evidence that either is dishonest; it is a signal to use the live order line as the source of truth.":"将每个电子表格价格视为日期参考。中国市场的列表通常会将多种颜色、尺寸、捆绑甚至不同的产品组合在一个页面上。最低的可见数字可能属于配件或更简单的变体。卖家还可以修改价格和国内运费。目录和实时列表之间的差异并不能自动证明其中任何一个都是不诚实的。这是使用实时订单线作为事实来源的信号。","Trustpilot currently marks Hipobuy’s rating as unavailable because of a breach of its guidelines and says it removed a number of fake reviews. That is a material moderation signal. It means a responsible customer-review article should not average visible praise into a confident score or treat every negative claim as verified. Separate official platform claims, documented interface facts, individual experiences and facts that cannot be independently checked.":"Trustpilot 目前将 Hipobuy 的评级标记为不可用，因为它违反了其指导方针，并表示它删除了一些虚假评论。这是一个物质调节信号。这意味着一篇负责任的客户评论文章不应将可见的赞扬平均为一个自信的分数，也不应将每一个负面声明都视为经过验证的。单独的官方平台声明、记录的界面事实、个人经验和无法独立检查的事实。","Twelve focused routes":"十二条重点路线","UPDATED 22 AUG 2026 · INDEPENDENT GUIDE":"更新于 2026 年 8 月 22 日 · 独立指南","USD REF.":"美元参考值","Understand actual and volumetric weight":"了解实际重量和体积重量","Understand the service before you order":"下单前了解服务内容","Use early volumetric calculations for scenarios, not promises. Once warehouse data is available, compare measured weights and, if the live workflow offers rehearsal or pre-packing, consider it for bulky or mixed baskets. The packed dimensions are more useful than seller dimensions, which may describe a product rather than its shipping carton.":"使用早期的体积计算来预测场景，而不是承诺。获得仓库数据后，比较测量的重量，如果实时工作流程提供排练或预包装，请考虑将其用于大型或混合篮子。包装尺寸比卖家尺寸更有用，卖家尺寸可能描述产品而不是其运输纸箱。","Use every image to answer a specific question. If the required area is outside the frame, blurred or covered, the honest conclusion is “not confirmed.” It is not “probably fine.” This distinction sounds strict, but it prevents hope from becoming an approval decision. A targeted extra photo or measurement is often cheaper than discovering a mismatch after international delivery.":"使用每张图像来回答一个特定问题。如果所需区域在框外、模糊或被覆盖，则诚实的结论是“未确认”。这不是“可能没问题”。这种区别听起来很严格，但它阻止了希望成为批准决定。有针对性的额外照片或测量通常比国际交付后发现不匹配要便宜。","Use low, expected and high scenarios instead of pretending that an early estimate is exact. A compact item with few restrictions may remain close to the expected case. Bulky packaging, a restricted product, a rural destination or a different chargeable weight can move the total upward. If the purchase only makes sense in the lowest scenario, it is probably not ready to order.":"使用低、预期和高情景，而不是假装早期估计是准确的。限制较少的紧凑项目可能仍接近预期情况。大件包装、受限产品、乡村目的地或不同的计费重量可能会导致总量上升。如果购买仅在最低情况下有意义，则可能尚未准备好订购。","Use measured warehouse data and the live quote. Treat earlier values only as planning references.":"使用测量的仓库数据和实时报价。仅将早期值视为规划参考。","Use measurements instead of size letters":"使用测量值代替尺寸字母","Use one verifiable instruction per line.":"每行使用一条可验证指令。","Use storage and consolidation as planning tools":"使用存储和整合作为规划工具","Use the current order line—not the spreadsheet thumbnail—for price.":"使用当前订单行（而不是电子表格缩略图）来获取价格。","Use warehouse QC as a decision gate":"使用仓库 QC 作为决策门","Useful guides,":"有用的指南，","Variant match":"变体匹配","Visible damage":"可见损坏","Volumetric weight represents the space the parcel occupies.":"体积重量代表包裹所占的空间。","Warehouse decision system":"仓库决策系统","Warehouse images reduce visible risk, but they do not certify authenticity, hidden materials, exact fit or long-term performance. Lighting can shift color, glare can resemble a scratch and a photograph can hide depth. When a material question remains unanswered, request a targeted close-up or measurement. “Please photograph the mark beside the left zipper under direct light” is more useful than “send better photos.”":"仓库图像可以降低可见风险，但不能证明真实性、隐藏材料、精确配合或长期性能。灯光可以改变颜色，眩光可以像划痕，照片可以隐藏深度。当重大问题仍未得到解答时，要求进行有针对性的特写或测量。 “请在直射光下拍摄左侧拉链旁边的标记”比“发送更好的照片”更有用。","Warehouse quality-control photos are one of the main reasons to use an agent workflow. Begin with order matching: size label, color, quantity, version and included components. Then review overall shape, symmetry, construction, visible marks and packaging. A pleasing first photo is not enough; inspect every available angle and compare the received item with the listing details you recorded.":"仓库质量控制照片是使用代理工作流程的主要原因之一。从订单匹配开始：尺码标签、颜色、数量、版本和随附组件。然后检查整体形状、对称性、结构、可见标记和包装。一张令人愉悦的第一张照片是不够的；检查每个可用的角度，并将收到的物品与您记录的列表详细信息进行比较。","What do current customer reviews actually show?":"当前的客户评论实际上表明了什么？","What does Hipobuy say it does?":"Hipobuy 说的是什么？","What does ‘link checked’ mean?":"“链接已检查”是什么意思？","What is Hipobuy?":"什么是Hipobuy？","When the issue matters, describe the location precisely: “the pale mark two centimetres below the right pocket” or “the dent on the outer corner beside the zipper.” Ask for the area under clear light, with packaging moved if that can be done safely. A generic request for “more photos” may produce another wide shot that answers nothing.":"当问题很重要时，请准确描述位置：“右口袋下方两厘米处的苍白标记”或“拉链旁边外角的凹痕”。要求在明亮光线下的区域，如果可以安全地移动包装。对“更多照片”的一般要求可能会产生另一个没有任何答案的广角镜头。","When the parcel is ready, verify the destination, measured weight, dimensions, content classification and packaging request. Compare route estimates using the same parcel. Note the billing unit and whether the screen shows an estimate, deposit or final adjustment process. Terminology can change, so read the current checkout explanation instead of relying on an old tutorial.":"包裹准备好后，验证目的地、测量重量、尺寸、内容分类和包装要求。比较使用同一地块的路线估计。请注意计费单位以及屏幕是否显示估算、存款或最终调整过程。术语可能会发生变化，因此请阅读当前的结账说明，而不是依赖旧的教程。","When the warehouse marks an item as received, match it to the correct order before judging quality. Similar product names and repeated purchases make mix-ups possible. Check the order number, quantity and visible labels. Keep dated screenshots of important status changes, messages and refunds. An orderly record is more useful than a long emotional message if something later needs investigation.":"当仓库将商品标记为已收到时，请在判断质量之前将其与正确的订单进行匹配。相似的产品名称和重复购买可能会造成混淆。检查订单号、数量和可见标签。保留重要状态更改、消息和退款的最新屏幕截图。如果事后需要调查，有序的记录比长篇情感信息更有用。","Women":"女性","Write down each assumption rather than one total. For example: estimated item weight, likely package dimensions, whether boxes stay, destination, content category and candidate route. When the warehouse records real data, replace the assumptions line by line. This turns one shipment into better evidence for the next without pretending that two parcels will be identical.":"写下每个假设而不是一个总数。例如：估计的物品重量、可能的包裹尺寸、箱子是否停留、目的地、内容类别和候选路线。当仓库记录真实数据时，逐行替换假设。这使得一批货物成为下一批货物的更好证据，而无需假装两个包裹是相同的。","Write objective order instructions":"编写客观订单指令","Yes. Current official app descriptions advertise 90 days of free warehouse storage; confirm live terms before relying on it.":"是的。当前的官方应用程序描述宣传 90 天免费仓库存储；在依赖之前确认实时条款。","Yes. Hipobuy’s current official app descriptions advertise 90 days of free storage so orders can be collected before shipping. Treat that as a current platform statement and confirm the live account terms, start date and any item-specific limits before relying on the full period.":"是的。 Hipobuy 目前的官方应用程序描述宣传有 90 天的免费存储空间，因此可以在发货前收集订单。将其视为当前平台声明，并在依赖完整期间之前确认真实账户条款、开始日期和任何特定于项目的限制。","Zoom in on stitching, edges, closures, hardware, printed areas and attachment points. Separate cosmetic variation from functional damage.":"放大缝合、边缘、闭合、硬件、印刷区域和连接点。将外观变化与功能损伤分开。","a product link.":"产品链接。","category routes":"类别路线","checked rows":"选中的行","kept practical.":"保持实用。","last link check":"最后链接检查","not a feeling.":"不是一种感觉。","not an endless scroll.":"不是无尽的卷轴。","snapshot":"快照","volumetric weight":"体积重量","vs":"与","¥140 snapshot":"140日元快照","¥160 snapshot":"160日元快照","¥280 snapshot":"280日元快照","¥330 snapshot":"330日元快照","¥399 snapshot":"¥399 快照","¥89 snapshot":"89元快照"}')}]);